# Everything lyna-tmux wrote, listed before anything is removed. The scene
# stops at the question: answering it either removes the files or prints the
# error of a command that was refused, and neither belongs in the film.
title lmux uninstall
size 134 36
pre lmux kill --all
run demo-shell
wait 1
type clear
enter
wait 0.5
chapter Uninstall
caption lmux uninstall | everything it wrote, listed before anything is removed
type lmux uninstall
enter
wait 2.5
frame 5
